   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "CANON IS DEFINED BY ITS TIMESCALE\n\n\"A canon diff should read as ADDITION.\"\n\nFrequent edits to existing canon lines are a smell\n\u2014 either the line was never canon (demote it) or\nsomething real shifted (a pivot, which deserves\nceremony).",
   "originalText": "CANON IS DEFINED BY ITS TIMESCALE\n\n\"A canon diff should read as ADDITION.\"\n\nFrequent edits to existing canon lines are a smell\n\u2014 either the line was never canon (demote it) or\nsomething real shifted (a pivot, which deserves\nceremony).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": false
