   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "PROMOTION / DEMOTION\n\nharvest or notice -> fold, IN OWN WORDS -> curate\n(explicit, dated)\n\nDiscovery flows up; canon almost never flows back\ndown. Demotion is legal but LOUD.",
   "originalText": "PROMOTION / DEMOTION\n\nharvest or notice -> fold, IN OWN WORDS -> curate\n(explicit, dated)\n\nDiscovery flows up; canon almost never flows back\ndown. Demotion is legal but LOUD.",
