   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "TWO ENCODINGS, ONE LADDER\n\nFILES carry maturity by ADDRESS \u2014 the filename law\nIS the ladder. Promotion is a MOVE, and a move that\nbreaks references loudly is a feature.\n\nPACK / LORE / SCOPE items carry a stage FIELD from\nbirth:\nwip | provisional | established |\ncanonical | superseded | retired",
   "originalText": "TWO ENCODINGS, ONE LADDER\n\nFILES carry maturity by ADDRESS \u2014 the filename law\nIS the ladder. Promotion is a MOVE, and a move that\nbreaks references loudly is a feature.\n\nPACK / LORE / SCOPE items carry a stage FIELD from\nbirth:\nwip | provisional | established |\ncanonical | superseded | retired",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": false
