   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "TAXONOMY says WHAT KIND.\nSTAGE says HOW TRUSTED.\n\nMaturity is NOT audience/placement, and NOT feature\nlifecycle. Both are habitually conflated with it.",
   "originalText": "TAXONOMY says WHAT KIND.\nSTAGE says HOW TRUSTED.\n\nMaturity is NOT audience/placement, and NOT feature\nlifecycle. Both are habitually conflated with it.",
